#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/mystmd.rst:2
msgid "Deploying MyST Markdown on Read the Docs"
msgstr "在 Read the Docs 上部署 MyST Markdown"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/mystmd.rst:7
msgid ""
"`MyST Markdown`_ is a set of open-source, community-driven tools designed "
"for scientific communication, including a powerful authoring framework that "
"supports blogs, online books, scientific papers, reports and journal "
"articles."
msgstr ""
"`MyST Markdown`_ "
"是一套开源、社区驱动的工具，专为科学交流而设计，其中包含一个强大的创作框架，支持博客、在线书籍、科学论文、报告和期刊文章。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/mystmd.rst:10
msgid ""
"Minimal configuration is required to build an existing MyST Markdown project"
" on Read the Docs."
msgstr "在 Read the Docs 上构建现有 MyST Markdown 项目所需的配置极少。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/intro/mystmd.rst:12
